sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 用户
    participant A as App
    participant S as Server
    U->>+A: 打开文档
    A->>+S: GET /doc
    loop Every minute
        S->>S: Health check
    end
    alt is cached
        S-->>A: 304 Not Modified
    else is new
        S-->>A: 200 OK with a rather long label that needs space
    end
    deactivate S
    Note right of S: Server keeps the session
    Note over U,A: The user waits
    opt Offline
        A-xS: retry
    end
    A-->>-U: 显示
